# Intermediate / Cache
EmploymentProj/Intermediate/
EmploymentProj/Plugins/**/Intermediate/
EmploymentProj/DerivedDataCache/

# Editor generated
EmploymentProj/Saved/

# Built data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Precompiled Assets
EmploymentProj/SourceArt/**/*.png
EmploymentProj/SourceArt/**/*.tga

